WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.845
This is the Visenza owner dashboard, shown with example records.

2
00:00:05.583 --> 00:00:11.497
The overview counts contacts, new leads and the newsletter list, and shows where each lead came from.

3
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:19.642
In the CRM, quiz, landing page and ManyChat contacts share one table, with consent and source on every row.

4
00:00:20.283 --> 00:00:26.327
Filters and search narrow the list: first the landing page leads, then one contact by name.

5
00:00:27.683 --> 00:00:34.308
On the pipeline board, the owner drags Mara from Nurture to Cohort interested to move the follow-up forward.

6
00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:40.771
One dashboard to review contacts and move each lead to its next step.
